<p>Hello! This is my portfolio. Here, you'll find my introduction to you and a compilation of stuff I've made.</p>
<h1 id="mcetoc_1k115fbhmk">Introduction</h1>
<p>My name is Eza, and I'm currently 17 (as of writing this) in Seattle, WA. I'm a high school student, and I'm looking forward to pursuing more engineering projects in the future. I'm also the lead design and CAD for the VEX Robotics team 90385B Pumas: Bromine, and former programmer. Currently, I'm working on:<br><br></p>
<ul>
<li>Developing my team's robot for the 2026-2027 VRC game Override</li>
<li>Getting more awards for our robotics team</li>
<li>Learning more CAM software and 3D printing</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="mcetoc_1k117h3e75c">Experience I Have</h1>
<h2>Programming</h2>
<ul>
<li>Proficient in C++ (since 2024), for programming in my robotics team</li>
<li>Expert in Lua (since 2019), for developing games on the Roblox platform</li>
</ul>
<h2>Engineering</h2>
<ul>
<li>Novice in Fusion 360 (since 2025)</li>
<li>Novice in Carbide Create (since 2026)</li>
</ul>
